    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu achiniamba, “Phiya ukagule mkanda wa katani, udzifunge chibiruni ela usiugutize madzi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi nágula mkanda kulengana na Mwenyezi Mlungu arivyonilagiza na nchidzifunga chibiruni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha Mwenyezi Mlungu wagomba kano ya phiri achiamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Hala nyo mkanda uchiogula na udzifunge chibiruni, uphiye vivii hadi muho Yufurati ukaufwitse kpwenye panga za mawe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi naphiya nchendaufwitsa kanda-kanda ya muho Yufurati dza Mwenyezi Mlungu arivyokala akalagiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bada ya siku nyinji ye Mwenyezi Mlungu achiniamba, “Uka uphiye muho Yufurati ukahale nyo mkanda nriokuambira ukaufwitse kuko.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipho nchiuka nchiphiya ko muho Yufurati nchendauhala nyo mkanda nriokala nkaufwitsa, ela uchikala ukabanangika hata uchikala tauna mana tsona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha Mwenyezi Mlungu achiniamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwenyezi Mlungu wa Iziraeli anaamba hivi, ‘Hivi ndivyo ndivyobananga ngulu za atu a Juda na kudziunula sana kpwa atu a Jerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atu aha ayi, anaorema kuphundza neno rangu, alungao kuhenda vyo mioyo yao mifu ilondavyo na kulunga milungu yanjina, kuihumikira na kuiabudu, aho andakala dza nyo mkanda ambao tauna mana yoyosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana dza vira ambavyo mkanda nkukala chibiruni mwa mutu, ndivyo nrivyohenda nyumba yosi ya Iziraeli na nyumba yosi ya Juda aungane nami, ili akale atu angu, amanyikane kpwa dzina rangu, aphahe nguma na utukufu, ela taayaphundza, mimi Mwenyezi Mlungu nkaamba.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kpwa hivyo aambire hivi, ‘Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wa Iziraeli anaamba, “Chila chiburu chindaodzazwa uchi.” ’ Nao andakuamba, ‘Hukale tahumanya kukala chila chiburu chindaodzazwa uchi?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipho undaambira, ‘Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba hivi, “Lola, nindaalevya atu osi asagalao tsi ihi: afalume asagarirao chihi cha Daudi, alavyadzi-sadaka, manabii na atu osi a Jerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami ndaafyakatsira enye kpwa enye, ano baba na ana ao. Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba, Sindaaonera mbazi, sindaaricha wala kuaonera huruma chiasi cha kukala nisiaolage.” ’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
